    "code": "# jaryan: moj-e morabba-ye kond. slider nim-dore ra migooyad.\n# bad az chand dore barname tamam mishavad ta adad-e multimeter sabet bemanad.\nfrom machine import Pin, ADC\nimport time\n\nknob = ADC(Pin(34))\nknob.atten(ADC.ATTN_11DB)\nend = ADC(Pin(35))\nend.atten(ADC.ATTN_11DB)\ndrive = Pin(14, Pin.OUT)\n\nhalf = max(1, round(knob.read() * 100 / 4095)) * 0.01\ncycles = max(3, int(1.5 / (2 * half)) + 1)\n\nfor i in range(cycles):\n    drive.value(1)\n    time.sleep(half)\n    drive.value(0)\n    time.sleep(half)\n\nif end.read() > 2000:\n    drive.value(1)\n    time.sleep(half)\n",
